  "availability_rationale": [
    "All inspected 2015–2026 official annual FF3 archive downloads are accessible without fee or login.",
    "The official archive supplies one yearly cut: July2015–July2025; the 2026 entry supplies August data in the September2026 update directory.",
    "These are archived versions of monthly factor-return histories, not an archive of every monthly publication vintage.",
    "The official Data Library states that the full return history is reconstructed during monthly updates and can change when the underlying CRSP database is revised.",
    "Using a later cut to populate factors at earlier monthly decision dates would backdate revised information.",
    "Using only the latest already-published annual cut leaves intervening monthly observations unavailable for the original monthly residual-momentum protocol.",
    "Exact original release days were not certified. Directory months and the official annual release description establish only month-level release context; current HTTP Last-Modified headers are not original release proof."
  ],
